flowchart TB
    U[Browser: JSP + JSTL + CSS + jQuery/AJAX] --> MVC[Spring MVC routing]
    MVC --> C[Feature Controllers]
    C --> P[Service Ports / Interfaces]
    P --> S[Domain Service Implementations]
    S --> V[Shared Business Rules + Validators]
    S --> R[Spring Data JPA Repositories]
    R --> H[Hibernate / JPA]
    H --> F[Flyway-managed MySQL 8]
    S --> TX[Transactional Workflows]
    TX --> R

    subgraph Modules[Feature-first modular monolith]
      CAT[Catalog: Products / Categories / Sellers]
      CUS[Customer: Customers / Addresses]
      CART[Cart: Carts / Cart Items]
      ORD[Orders: Orders / Payments / Returns / Shipments]
      INV[Inventory: Movements / Restock]
      REP[Reports: Dashboard / Reports]
    end
    C --> Modules
    Modules --> P
